// 压力：4001 个键按 `i*7919 % 4001` 的置换乱序插入（7919 与 4001 互素 ⇒ 键恰好是 0..4000 的一个排列）
// 判据：len 对 · 按序遍历恰好是 0,1,...,4000 且 valAt(i) = i%1000 · get 全对 · lowerBound(i) = i ·
//       删掉每个第 3 个键之后剩下的**严格递增**且个数对、删过的查不到、没删的都还在
// expect: n=4001|bad=0|gb=0|miss=-7|lb=0|removed=1334|db=0|left=2667
use std::io
use stl::map

fn main() -> i32 {
    var m: map<i64, i32> = map<i64, i32>::withCap(i64(16))
    var i: i64 = i64(0)
    while i < i64(4001) {
        let k = (i * i64(7919)) % i64(4001)
        m.put(k, i32(k % i64(1000)))
        i = i + i64(1)
    }
    io::cout << "n=" << m.len() << " h=" << m.height() << " nodes=" << m.nodeCount()

    var bad: i64 = i64(0)
    i = i64(0)
    while i < m.len() {
        if m.keyAt(i) != i { bad = bad + i64(1) }
        var v: i32 = m.valAt(i)
        if i64(v) != i % i64(1000) { bad = bad + i64(1) }
        i = i + i64(1)
    }
    io::cout << " bad=" << bad

    var gb: i64 = i64(0)
    i = i64(0)
    while i < i64(4001) {
        var v: i32 = m.get(i) ?? i32(-1)
        if i64(v) != i % i64(1000) { gb = gb + i64(1) }
        i = i + i64(1)
    }
    var miss: i32 = m.get(i64(999999)) ?? i32(-7)
    io::cout << " gb=" << gb << " miss=" << i64(miss)

    var lb: i64 = i64(0)
    i = i64(0)
    while i <= i64(4001) {
        if m.lowerBound(i) != i { lb = lb + i64(1) }
        i = i + i64(1)
    }
    io::cout << " lb=" << lb

    var removed: i64 = i64(0)
    i = i64(0)
    while i < i64(4001) {
        if i % i64(3) == i64(0) {
            if m.remove(i) { removed = removed + i64(1) }
        }
        i = i + i64(1)
    }

    var db: i64 = i64(0)
    i = i64(0)
    while i < i64(4001) {
        var has: i64 = i64(0)
        if m.contains(i) { has = i64(1) }
        if i % i64(3) == i64(0) {
            if has == i64(1) { db = db + i64(1) }
        } else {
            if has == i64(0) { db = db + i64(1) }
        }
        i = i + i64(1)
    }
    var prev: i64 = i64(-1)
    var cnt: i64 = i64(0)
    i = i64(0)
    while i < m.len() {
        let kk = m.keyAt(i)
        if kk <= prev { db = db + i64(1) }
        prev = kk
        cnt = cnt + i64(1)
        i = i + i64(1)
    }
    io::cout << " removed=" << removed << " db=" << db << " left=" << cnt << "\n"
    return 0
}
